1
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:42,840
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:45,780
[Episode 14]

3
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,710
Where is the money?

4
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,430
I asked you, where is the money?

5
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:55,150
Money?

6
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,539
There's no more money.

7
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,200
-Are you all right, Lord Wei?
-Lord Wei.

8
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,910
What a brilliant scheme, My Lord.

9
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:24,560
This move is very exquisite.

10
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:27,470
On one hand, you quelled the disaster.

11
00:02:27,590 --> 00:02:28,650
On the other hand,

12
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,480
you forced the grain merchants

13
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:32,120
to lower their prices.

14
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,470
Lord Yan, you really

15
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,800
have Hengtang in the palm of your hand.

16
00:02:39,390 --> 00:02:43,760
But I am a little worried
about Your Lordship.

17
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:46,240
The situation in the future

18
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,280
will probably be difficult to control.

19
00:02:51,710 --> 00:02:53,560
I haven't thought about that.

20
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:57,079
No matter what the situation is
in the future,

21
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,870
I must thank Lord Xie.

22
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,630
If not for your secret help,

23
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:04,040
I couldn't have pulled this off.

24
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,150
I will definitely go
to the capital in the future

25
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:08,120
and put in a few good words for you.

26
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:10,870
Thank you.

27
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,120
Lord Xie,

28
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:17,560
aren't you going with me to see
how grandly the disaster relief is going?

29
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:18,470
Lord Yan,

30
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:20,400
as you can see,

31
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,310
Shu

32
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,480
has family matters to deal with,

33
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,670
so he asked for a day off.

34
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,240
You'd better go back first.

35
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:31,710
Qingyuan,

36
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,280
see the guest out.

37
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,280
Yes.

38
00:03:57,130 --> 00:04:01,260
♪ I counted every moment ♪

39
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:05,370
♪ Memories take roots;
the annual rings grow ♪

40
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:09,910
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

41
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:14,670
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

42
00:04:14,770 --> 00:04:18,870
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

43
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,310
Your Lordship,

44
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,950
Everyone says you are a corrupt official,

45
00:04:18,890 --> 00:04:23,280
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

46
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:20,560
but I never expected

47
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,190
that today you would

48
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:24,390
save countless starving people
in Hengtang,

49
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:29,960
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

50
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:25,810
and save me as well.

51
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:28,750
I genuinely admire Your Lordship.

52
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,430
From now on, wherever Your Lordship goes
to listen to music,

53
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:33,650
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

54
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:34,390
drink with courtesans, or spend money,

55
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:39,190
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

56
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:35,630
if you're willing,

57
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,270
-I—
-What?

58
00:04:39,220 --> 00:04:43,780
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

59
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,000
What did you say I'd spend money on?

60
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:47,980
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

61
00:04:48,010 --> 00:04:52,580
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

62
00:04:50,870 --> 00:04:52,600
Thank you for saving me today,
Your Lordship.

63
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:57,050
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

64
00:04:57,080 --> 00:05:01,560
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

65
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:06,030
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

66
00:05:06,050 --> 00:05:11,570
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

67
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,530
It's not safe in Hengtang tonight.

68
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,000
If I'm not around,

69
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,800
you must protect yourself.

70
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,120
Bad news, Master!

71
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,430
Master, bad news!

72
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,530
Chuntai...

73
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:42,080
stopped breathing.

74
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:44,000
Master...

75
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:48,680
I gave birth to two sons
for the Xie family,

76
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:52,430
and I raised Zhenglun so well.

77
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:54,560
Yet you say I'm faking it.

78
00:05:55,510 --> 00:05:59,040
Why couldn't Xie Qingyuan
be the one faking it?

79
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:04,720
-I didn't kill anyone.
-Mother, please get up.

80
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:07,480
You're bullying me!

81
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,310
Enough.

82
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:11,010
Things outside are annoying enough.

83
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,720
As for how your matter should be handled,

84
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,120
Master and Old Madam will decide.

85
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:17,270
Aren't you the Head Madam?

86
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,180
You can make the decision.

87
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,000
Yes.

88
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,720
Everyone, calm down.

89
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,610
Donglin.

90
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:28,080
What is Wei Changyan

91
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,560
up to?

92
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,390
I sent someone to investigate,

93
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,590
but there's no reply.

94
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:33,360
However,

95
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,680
I heard the east pier
is in chaos right now—

96
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,880
the grain merchants
are making a scene.

97
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,270
Listen to me.

98
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:47,390
Without my permission today,

99
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:50,610
no one is allowed to
step out of the residence.

100
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,390
Yes!

101
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,870
Calm down, everyone!

102
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,120
Calm down!

103
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,310
Please listen to me!

104
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:58,840
Lord Wei.

105
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:00,310
Our ships

106
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,870
have been docked here
for over half a month!

107
00:07:01,870 --> 00:07:03,510
If you don't buy our grain now,

108
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:04,510
what are we supposed to do?

109
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:06,040
Exactly, what should we do?

110
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:07,430
What should we do?

111
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,560
How are we supposed to live?

112
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,270
The grain collection
was agreed to be today.

113
00:07:12,270 --> 00:07:13,750
Why are you giving grain away instead?

114
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,630
A bunch of evil officials!

115
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:15,270
Liars!

116
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:16,380
-Liars!
-Liars!

117
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,600
That's a big claim!

118
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:21,040
You're speaking nonsense!

119
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,830
H-How dare you!

120
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,830
Insolent commoners!

121
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,160
Outrageous!

122
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,480
Bastards!

123
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:33,750
Outrageous, really.

124
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:40,000
Lord Wei,

125
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,430
where are you going?

126
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:42,950
Isn't it time to pay

127
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,920
the profit you promised me?

128
00:07:45,830 --> 00:07:46,560
Sir,

129
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,940
you don't understand.

130
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,770
There must be

131
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:50,680
some misunderstanding here.

132
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,480
Go back and wait for me for a few days.

133
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:55,210
I will definitely give you
an explanation, okay?

134
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:57,040
We agreed on today,

135
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,800
so it must be today.

136
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:00,680
But...

137
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,360
the price difference
for these 1,800 dan of grain,

138
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,420
even if you kill me, I can't afford it.

139
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:38,000
Help!

140
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,919
Help!

141
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:47,270
Guards!

142
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,360
Guards!

143
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,630
You guys go this way

144
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,030
and block the front door!

145
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,840
The rest, follow me this way!

146
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,910
Mother, what's going on?

147
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,030
I don't know.

148
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:58,240
With the city tower drums
beating like that,

149
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,750
if they weren't collecting grain
in the middle of the night,

150
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:02,880
I would have thought
they were crying out my grievances.

151
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,720
What's going on?

152
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,520
I have no idea.

153
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:05,550
Master!

154
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,480
Father!

155
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,320
Master!

156
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,150
Father!

157
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:08,920
Master...

158
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,120
Old Madam!

159
00:09:11,390 --> 00:09:12,120
Nanny Liu.

160
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,910
Old Madam!

161
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:14,480
What is going on?

162
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,030
It's complete chaos outside.

163
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:18,360
These northern bandits
have reached the outer city!

164
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,670
They specifically target wealthy families.

165
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,960
They say the northern bandits...

166
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,790
They kill any men they see,

167
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,400
and as for women, they...

168
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,150
What should we do?

169
00:09:36,150 --> 00:09:36,790
Don't be afraid.

170
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:37,650
Mother is here.

171
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:39,440
Don't be afraid. It's okay.

172
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,970
Father and Mother are here.

173
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,330
Don't panic.

174
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,240
Stay calm!

175
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:44,390
Yuejian,

176
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,200
put out all unnecessary lights first

177
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,200
so we don't attract
the bandits' attention.

178
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,840
Yes.

179
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,120
Good thing you prepared in advance.

180
00:10:03,150 --> 00:10:04,960
Trouble really arrived today.

181
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,890
I'm more curious about

182
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:08,960
how these northern bandits

183
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:11,020
managed to break through so smoothly

184
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:12,790
and reach the outer city.

185
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:16,000
Who cares how they broke in?

186
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,910
We must kill the bandits,

187
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:20,370
but all the more must Wei Changyan
be killed.

188
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,930
I've waited for 9 years,

189
00:10:22,630 --> 00:10:24,430
and I don't want to wait anymore.

190
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,330
Where do you think that scumbag

191
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,150
could be hiding?

192
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,720
Lord Yan!

193
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,510
I don't care what my father thinks.

194
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:29,150
If he won't help you,

195
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:29,790
I will.

196
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,440
In the past, I only thought

197
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,040
you were a corrupt official.

198
00:11:33,150 --> 00:11:34,480
Only today did I realize

199
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,050
you bore all that infamy

200
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,170
to protect the people of Hengtang.

201
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:41,000
I absolutely won't stand by
and do nothing.

202
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:43,270
We will protect the people with you.

203
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:48,870
Report!

204
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,080
The northern bandits have reached
the outside of the south gate!

205
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:52,810
Understood.

206
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:55,200
Pei Guanling,

207
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:57,480
notify all major city gates
to defend strictly.

208
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,390
Do not let a single bandit

209
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,750
slip through.

210
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,650
Yes, sir.

211
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,440
Soldiers!

212
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:08,790
Now,

213
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,210
the time has come to prove yourselves.

214
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,440
Please follow me to wipe out the bandits

215
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,370
and defend the people of Hengtang.

216
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:18,390
Kill them!

217
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,520
-Kill!
-Kill!

218
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,360
-Kill!
-Kill!

219
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,200
-Kill!
-Kill!

220
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:22,070
-Kill!
-Kill!

221
00:12:57,870 --> 00:12:58,550
Mother,

222
00:12:58,550 --> 00:12:59,720
I'm scared.

223
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,550
Don't be afraid,

224
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:01,680
your father is here.

225
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,390
Master, bad news!

226
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:06,360
Master!

227
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,360
Master, bad news.

228
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:08,110
Master...

229
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,670
-What are you panicking for?
-Master...

230
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:10,750
Speak slowly.

231
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:11,960
Master,

232
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,360
the northern bandits...

233
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:15,220
they have attacked the East Gate.

234
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,080
They are burning, killing,
and looting everywhere,

235
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,910
and will be here soon.

236
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:20,200
What should we do?

237
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:27,840
Mother!

238
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,370
What are you panicking for?

239
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,800
With the patriarch around,

240
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,700
what's there to panic for?

241
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:37,630
Nanny Liu,

242
00:13:38,270 --> 00:13:39,150
keep an eye out.

243
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,940
If there is any situation,

244
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,290
report it immediately.

245
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,390
Yes, Madam.

246
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,270
Master...

247
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:53,720
Master,

248
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:57,900
why not ask the government office
to send troops to protect us?

249
00:13:58,790 --> 00:14:00,440
It's chaos outside.

250
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,320
The government office has few soldiers.

251
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:04,200
They can hardly protect themselves.

252
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:04,750
Then...

253
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,980
Then what should we do?

254
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,640
The Marquis' residence—

255
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,850
they have soldiers.

256
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,170
First Madam,

257
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:19,120
aren't you close
with the Marchioness of Danyang?

258
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:20,280
How about...

259
00:14:20,390 --> 00:14:22,250
I don't have that much influence.

260
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:27,840
However,

261
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,480
to ask of the Marquis' residence...

262
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:36,480
I'm afraid

263
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,460
only Fourth Lady can do it.

264
00:14:45,150 --> 00:14:46,120
That's right.

265
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:50,030
Not only did they take a liking
to Qingyuan,

266
00:14:50,510 --> 00:14:53,170
she also has a close relationship
with Lord Yan.

267
00:14:53,390 --> 00:14:55,150
For her sake,

268
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:57,890
they probably wouldn't sit by
and do nothing.

269
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:01,910
Mother,

270
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,980
it's full of bandits outside.

271
00:15:04,510 --> 00:15:05,720
Who knows where

272
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,240
Lord Yan and the heir is?

273
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,790
Yet you're asking
a weak lady like her to...

274
00:15:08,790 --> 00:15:10,120
Who told you to speak? Sit down.

275
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:10,720
All right,

276
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:11,880
stop talking.

277
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:14,870
Right now,

278
00:15:16,030 --> 00:15:19,150
even if we mobilize soldiers
from all the residences,

279
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:22,270
distant water can't put out a nearby fire.

280
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:24,530
The personal guards of the Xie Residence

281
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,630
have just left for the Northern Frontier.

282
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:28,480
It seems this is the only way.

283
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:29,750
Qingyuan.

284
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:31,440
See if...

285
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:33,750
you can risk

286
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,660
going to the Yan residence

287
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,720
to ask Lord Yan for reinforcements.

288
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:14,240
Kill!

289
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:22,510
Hurry!

290
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,240
I know

291
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:32,440
I shouldn't ask a weak lady like you

292
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:35,320
to risk your life for something like this.

293
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,440
But the Xie family...

294
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:45,550
Never mind.

295
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:47,720
Forget it.

296
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,670
Mother.

297
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,390
I am unfilial.

298
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,360
Last Lantern Festival,

299
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:56,790
I had a dream.

300
00:16:57,910 --> 00:17:00,790
In the dream, a boy sang:

301
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:04,640
"All flowers fade during the full moon."

302
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,480
It seems this prophecy

303
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:09,270
is coming true today.

304
00:17:10,030 --> 00:17:14,310
Alas, the century-old foundation
of our Xie family

305
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,829
is coming to an end.

306
00:17:27,790 --> 00:17:28,830
Qingyuan.

307
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,930
If it weren't an emergency,

308
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:33,060
I wouldn't want you to take this risk.

309
00:17:33,310 --> 00:17:35,350
I wish I could take your place.

310
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:37,750
But right now, only you

311
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,680
can save the Xie family.

312
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,440
Are you willing to go?

313
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,960
We can talk about other things

314
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:44,760
after we survive this disaster.

315
00:17:46,550 --> 00:17:47,240
Mother.

316
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,310
It's too dangerous.

317
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:52,200
I will go.

318
00:17:56,790 --> 00:17:57,680
My Lady.

319
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,790
Stay here.

320
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:00,880
Don't cause me trouble.

321
00:18:14,510 --> 00:18:15,910
But I have one condition.

322
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:18,240
After the bandit rebellion is quelled,

323
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,310
my mother's case

324
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,260
must be thoroughly reinvestigated.

325
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,480
No one

326
00:18:30,790 --> 00:18:32,070
is allowed to refuse.

327
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:42,200
All right.

328
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,750
As long as

329
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,590
you're willing to save the Xie Residence,

330
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,400
we'll agree to any request.

331
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:53,240
Old Madam.

332
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:55,920
Master?

333
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,640
I'll go with Fourth Sister.

334
00:19:03,310 --> 00:19:03,960
Nonsense!

335
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,500
What are you going for?

336
00:19:06,030 --> 00:19:06,750
Qingyuan.

337
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:08,970
For the sake of the family,

338
00:19:09,270 --> 00:19:10,830
please make the trip.

339
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,240
Zhenglun,

340
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:15,170
take good care of your sister.

341
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:17,880
Yes.

342
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,940
If anything happens to her,

343
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:21,070
I won't forgive you!

344
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,200
Yes!

345
00:19:23,550 --> 00:19:24,200
Qingyuan.

346
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:28,140
We're counting on you.

347
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:30,310
Be careful.

348
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:00,880
Close the city gates!

349
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:06,710
Close the city gates!

350
00:21:06,750 --> 00:21:08,550
Stop the bandits from escaping!

351
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:29,960
After them!

352
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,280
Over here!

353
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:20,920
Here!

354
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:21,640
Quick!

355
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:22,550
Quick!

356
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:25,250
Chase them!

357
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:26,110
Stop!

358
00:22:26,310 --> 00:22:26,910
Don't run!

359
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:29,110
Stop!

360
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:30,920
This way!

361
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,770
Thank you, Brother.

362
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,480
You are willing to take risks

363
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:36,680
to seek help for the Xie family—
a great act of righteousness.

364
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,830
But I always believe

365
00:22:38,270 --> 00:22:41,000
that my mother
didn't kill anyone on her own will.

366
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:44,290
Please, Fourth Sister,

367
00:22:44,830 --> 00:22:46,090
don't blame my mother.

368
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,110
Over here!

369
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:52,880
Go find Lord Yan.

370
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,030
What about you—

371
00:22:55,030 --> 00:22:55,770
Go!

372
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:03,730
Go quickly!

373
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:33,200
Che!

374
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:39,180
I think I saw Wei Changyan.

375
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,720
Lord Yan!

376
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:48,720
Lord Yan!

377
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,400
There's a riot in the east of the city.

378
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,550
What about the Xie Residence?

379
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:52,480
The Xie Residence is fine.

380
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:53,340
I just heard...

381
00:24:53,750 --> 00:24:54,410
Heard what?

382
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:57,700
They asked Fourth Lady
to seek help from Your Lordship.

383
00:24:57,750 --> 00:24:58,480
Where is she?

384
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,240
Not sure yet.

385
00:25:03,830 --> 00:25:05,270
The enemy is right in front of you,

386
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,960
and you're still thinking about
that woman?

387
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,890
Do you really think you're Yan Rui?

388
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:17,590
Che.

389
00:25:18,550 --> 00:25:19,880
Wait for me to come back.

390
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:25,930
Brother!

391
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:28,440
Shen Run!

392
00:25:48,510 --> 00:25:49,370
Your Lordship!

393
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:50,410
Your Lordship!

394
00:25:50,610 --> 00:25:51,420
General!

395
00:25:51,750 --> 00:25:53,920
I am Qingyuan, the fourth daughter
of the army inspector Xie family.

396
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,180
My family is in danger!

397
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,300
Please save them, Your Lordship!

398
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:58,400
My Lord!

399
00:25:58,640 --> 00:25:59,350
My Lord!

400
00:26:00,590 --> 00:26:01,400
My Lord!

401
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,350
No shouting!

402
00:26:03,830 --> 00:26:06,480
Closing the city gates is to prevent
bandits from sneaking in.

403
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,270
Why?

404
00:26:07,270 --> 00:26:08,400
Exactly! Why?

405
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,070
Your Lordship.

406
00:26:19,070 --> 00:26:20,160
I am the fourth daughter of

407
00:26:20,160 --> 00:26:21,350
the army inspector
Xie Residence of Hengtang.

408
00:26:21,350 --> 00:26:24,410
My family is trapped.
Please save them, Your Lordship.

409
00:26:31,590 --> 00:26:32,750
I didn't bring any money,

410
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:34,080
only this jade pendant.

411
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:36,200
Please do me a favor, Your Lordship.

412
00:26:37,510 --> 00:26:38,360
We heed the imperial decree!

413
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:39,960
We heed the imperial decree!

414
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,210
Fourth Lady.

415
00:26:51,270 --> 00:26:52,240
Master Pei!

416
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:54,350
My eldest brother...

417
00:26:54,350 --> 00:26:55,350
He's surrounded by bandits.

418
00:26:55,350 --> 00:26:56,110
Go save him!

419
00:26:56,110 --> 00:26:58,710
He's in the third alley
on the street behind us.

420
00:27:00,030 --> 00:27:00,640
Follow me!

421
00:27:09,750 --> 00:27:10,480
Fourth Lady.

422
00:27:10,830 --> 00:27:11,890
This jade pendant,

423
00:27:12,110 --> 00:27:13,370
where did it come from?

424
00:27:16,070 --> 00:27:17,440
Lord Yan gave it to me.

425
00:27:17,590 --> 00:27:19,390
Do you recognize it, Master Pei?

426
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:21,410
Put the jade pendant away quickly.

427
00:27:23,310 --> 00:27:24,720
This is an imperially bestowed

428
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:25,550
pass.

429
00:27:25,730 --> 00:27:27,270
From the Imperial Throne Room

430
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:28,790
down to the imperial guards,

431
00:27:28,790 --> 00:27:30,030
anyone holding this token

432
00:27:30,030 --> 00:27:31,510
will have all doors opened for them,

433
00:27:31,510 --> 00:27:32,960
passing without hindrance.

434
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,220
If it weren't wartime,

435
00:27:34,310 --> 00:27:36,110
I would have to speak to you on my knees.

436
00:27:36,110 --> 00:27:36,960
Lord Yan

437
00:27:37,270 --> 00:27:38,400
is really generous.

438
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:46,700
We'll form an alliance

439
00:27:47,990 --> 00:27:49,250
and share weal and woe.

440
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:59,550
So you treat what I gave you

441
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:01,510
as a mere toy.

442
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,930
Anyway, it's all just stuff

443
00:28:05,070 --> 00:28:06,800
that was forced on me by others.

444
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:11,730
I really don't think
I need that jade pendant.

445
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,570
Then listen carefully.

446
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:21,110
You will need it.

447
00:28:45,350 --> 00:28:46,070
Master Pei,

448
00:28:46,550 --> 00:28:47,880
take me to find Lord Yan.

449
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:35,030
Master Pei!

450
00:29:35,590 --> 00:29:36,480
Master Pei!

451
00:29:37,350 --> 00:29:38,440
Lord Yan is in the west of the city,

452
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:40,440
surrounded by a large group of bandits.

453
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:41,350
What did you say?

454
00:29:41,350 --> 00:29:42,200
What happened to Yan Rui?

455
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:44,070
When Master Shen's reinforcements arrived,

456
00:29:44,070 --> 00:29:45,830
there were only dozens of corpses
on the ground.

457
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:47,230
There were no survivors.

458
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,170
Where is Yan Rui?

459
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,480
We're identifying the bodies.

460
00:29:50,480 --> 00:29:51,400
Lord Yan's survival

461
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,310
is unknown.

462
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:56,050
But I heard there are no survivors
in the west of the city.

463
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,270
Lord Yan may have…

464
00:29:57,270 --> 00:29:57,880
Shut up!

465
00:29:59,160 --> 00:29:59,890
Find him now!

466
00:30:00,070 --> 00:30:00,720
Yes!

467
00:30:07,580 --> 00:30:14,470
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

468
00:30:08,510 --> 00:30:10,440
It's not safe in Hengtang tonight.

469
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,590
If I'm not around,

470
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:14,110
you must protect yourself.

471
00:30:14,500 --> 00:30:21,740
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

472
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:25,120
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

473
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,070
Xie Qingyuan.

474
00:30:25,150 --> 00:30:28,850
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

475
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:28,920
You've always prided yourself on
being able to see through people, right?

476
00:30:28,870 --> 00:30:35,720
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

477
00:30:29,720 --> 00:30:30,920
Why can't you tell

478
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,610
I have no ill intentions towards you?

479
00:30:35,790 --> 00:30:42,910
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

480
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:38,810
We'll form an alliance

481
00:30:39,310 --> 00:30:40,570
and share weal and woe.

482
00:30:42,590 --> 00:30:43,920
Compared to East Pearls,

483
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:50,210
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

484
00:30:45,270 --> 00:30:46,670
it seems you prefer jade.

485
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:50,110
I do have special feelings for you.

486
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:54,020
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

487
00:30:51,070 --> 00:30:53,200
It depends on whether you agree or not.

488
00:30:54,110 --> 00:30:57,470
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

489
00:30:57,600 --> 00:31:04,950
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

490
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,460
West of the city...

491
00:31:04,970 --> 00:31:11,420
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

492
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:06,270
Young Master Pei.

493
00:31:06,270 --> 00:31:07,110
Take me to the west.

494
00:31:07,110 --> 00:31:08,370
I have to find Lord Yan.

495
00:31:08,510 --> 00:31:09,590
The west is dangerous.

496
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:10,440
Don't act rashly.

497
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:10,920
No!

498
00:31:11,470 --> 00:31:18,720
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

499
00:31:12,160 --> 00:31:13,820
My family said I must find him.

500
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,370
I have to see him,

501
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:16,590
dead or alive.

502
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:17,590
I must see him!

503
00:31:18,740 --> 00:31:22,620
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

504
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:20,270
If Lord Yan were here,

505
00:31:20,550 --> 00:31:22,480
he wouldn't let you risk your life.

506
00:31:22,650 --> 00:31:25,190
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

507
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:25,270
-Back off!
-Let us out.

508
00:31:25,270 --> 00:31:26,270
Please let us out.

509
00:31:26,270 --> 00:31:27,160
Back off!

510
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,290
Move back!

511
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:29,510
Back!

512
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:32,030
Back!

513
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:32,790
Back!

514
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:40,930
You go first!

515
00:33:10,810 --> 00:33:17,360
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

516
00:33:17,390 --> 00:33:24,820
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

517
00:33:24,850 --> 00:33:28,620
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

518
00:33:28,640 --> 00:33:32,030
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

519
00:33:32,050 --> 00:33:38,880
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

520
00:33:38,910 --> 00:33:46,560
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

521
00:33:46,580 --> 00:33:53,950
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

522
00:33:53,980 --> 00:33:57,770
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

523
00:33:57,790 --> 00:34:01,030
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

524
00:34:01,050 --> 00:34:06,930
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

525
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:05,440
Sure.

526
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:06,750
We have a deal.

527
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:08,230
When you return to Hengtang,

528
00:34:08,230 --> 00:34:09,489
we'll still meet here.

529
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,600
With me around, don't be afraid,

530
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:19,739
Little Monkey.

531
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:34,960
Yan Rui!

532
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:36,360
Go!

533
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,449
Yan Rui is here!

534
00:34:39,550 --> 00:34:40,150
After him!

535
00:34:40,190 --> 00:34:40,719
Let's go.

536
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:53,480
After him!

537
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:55,480
After him!

538
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:41,230
I am Yan Rui.

539
00:37:41,710 --> 00:37:42,550
If you have the guts,

540
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:43,320
come at me.

541
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:44,880
Don't touch her.

542
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:46,480
Come on!

543
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,230
Good.

544
00:38:15,670 --> 00:38:17,000
What a man.

545
00:38:29,190 --> 00:38:29,800
Attack!

546
00:38:37,410 --> 00:38:41,540
♪ I counted every moment ♪

547
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:45,650
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

548
00:38:45,670 --> 00:38:50,190
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

549
00:38:50,220 --> 00:38:54,950
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

550
00:38:55,060 --> 00:38:59,150
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

551
00:38:59,170 --> 00:39:03,560
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

552
00:39:03,590 --> 00:39:10,240
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

553
00:39:10,310 --> 00:39:13,930
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

554
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:19,470
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

555
00:39:19,500 --> 00:39:22,670
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

556
00:40:00,070 --> 00:40:01,530
Lord Yan ordered me to come

557
00:40:01,630 --> 00:40:03,560
to borrow troops from the Marquis.

558
00:40:10,190 --> 00:40:10,720
Marquis.

559
00:40:11,590 --> 00:40:13,120
You two share the same goal.

560
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:15,190
One person can't accomplish it alone.

561
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:16,390
If you work together,

562
00:40:16,960 --> 00:40:19,230
you might just win.

563
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:21,320
It depends on whether you

564
00:40:21,880 --> 00:40:23,610
are willing to take the gamble.

565
00:40:39,510 --> 00:40:40,710
Kill!

566
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:43,590
Kill!

567
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:56,960
Kill!

568
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:48,360
